# A reference cycle leaks (decision 48 W6b deleted the cycle collector,
# plans/backlog/WEAK_AND_UNCOLLECTED_RC.md §6), and the `--debug-heap`
# oracle's live-at-exit count is its witness: the fixture's two cells are
# never dropped. The last command pins that `--cycle-collector` is gone. The
# test binary's output rides the runner's `-v` output with its build chatter,
# so stdout keeps only the probe line, the report's live-at-exit count and
# the error.
stdout_keep_match=(cycle: disposed [0-9]+|live at exit: [0-9]+ blocks|cycle-collector.*)
timeout=600
